    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Phil,<br><br><br>Is the class of the mirt object same every time ? i.e.SingleGroupClass?<br><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mod </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Science</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SingleGroupClass&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>attr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;package&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>If the class changes, on what basis it is subject to change?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanking you,<br><br>Irshad</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
